#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Designing packages for Yii applications"
msgstr "Diseñar paquetes para aplicaciones Yii"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "This page describes how to design a Composer package that adds behavior to a Yii application through configuration.  Use it when your package needs to register services, routes, events, commands, assets, migrations, translations, or a theme."
msgstr "Esta página describe cómo diseñar un paquete de Composer que añade comportamiento a una aplicación Yii mediante configuración. Úsala cuando tu paquete necesite registrar servicios, rutas, eventos, comandos, assets, migraciones, traducciones o un tema."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "For installing and updating packages in an application, see [Using packages](package.md)."
msgstr "Para instalar y actualizar paquetes en una aplicación, consulta [Usar paquetes](package.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Composer metadata"
msgstr "Metadatos de Composer"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Each package must have a `composer.json` file in its root directory. At minimum, define a package name, dependencies, autoloading, and Yii config metadata when the package integrates with a Yii application."
msgstr "Cada paquete debe tener un archivo `composer.json` en su directorio raíz. Como mínimo, define un nombre de paquete, las dependencias, la autocarga y, si el paquete se integra con una aplicación Yii, los metadatos de configuración de Yii."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use a package name in the `vendor-name/project-name` format:"
msgstr "Usa un nombre de paquete con el formato `vendor-name/project-name`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"description\": \"Blog integration for Yii applications\",\n"
"    \"require\": {\n"
"        \"php\": \">=8.2\",\n"
"        \"yiisoft/router\": \"^4.0\"\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"description\": \"Blog integration for Yii applications\",\n"
"    \"require\": {\n"
"        \"php\": \">=8.2\",\n"
"        \"yiisoft/router\": \"^4.0\"\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use stable dependency constraints for stable releases. Avoid using `yiisoft` as your vendor name because it is reserved for Yii packages."
msgstr "Usa restricciones de dependencias estables para las versiones estables. Evita usar `yiisoft` como nombre de vendor, porque está reservado para los paquetes de Yii."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package requires a Yii application, prefixing the project name with `yii-` can make that clear on Packagist."
msgstr "Si tu paquete requiere una aplicación Yii, añadir el prefijo `yii-` al nombre del proyecto puede dejarlo claro en Packagist."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package layout"
msgstr "Estructura del paquete"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "A Yii-aware package is a regular Composer package with PHP classes, optional resource files, and optional config files.  Keep the configuration in a predictable directory and make the public API explicit:"
msgstr "Un paquete preparado para Yii es un paquete de Composer normal con clases PHP, archivos de recursos opcionales y archivos de configuración opcionales. Mantén la configuración en un directorio predecible y haz explícita la API pública:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"composer.json\n"
"config/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    di.php\n"
"    di-providers.php\n"
"    routes.php\n"
"    events.php\n"
"    params-web.php\n"
"    params-console.php\n"
"    di-console.php\n"
"src/\n"
"    ...\n"
"assets/\n"
"    ...\n"
"migrations/\n"
"    ...\n"
"messages/\n"
"    ...\n"
"views/\n"
"    ...\n"
msgstr ""
"composer.json\n"
"config/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    di.php\n"
"    di-providers.php\n"
"    routes.php\n"
"    events.php\n"
"    params-web.php\n"
"    params-console.php\n"
"    di-console.php\n"
"src/\n"
"    ...\n"
"assets/\n"
"    ...\n"
"migrations/\n"
"    ...\n"
"messages/\n"
"    ...\n"
"views/\n"
"    ...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use only the files your package needs. For example, a package with console commands but no web routes does not need `routes.php`."
msgstr "Usa solo los archivos que necesite tu paquete. Por ejemplo, un paquete con comandos de consola pero sin rutas web no necesita `routes.php`."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Config plugin metadata"
msgstr "Metadatos del plugin de configuración"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Yii applications use [yiisoft/config](https://github.com/yiisoft/config) to discover package configuration.  Declare package config files in the `extra.config-plugin` section of `composer.json`:"
msgstr "Las aplicaciones Yii usan [yiisoft/config](https://github.com/yiisoft/config) para descubrir la configuración de los paquetes. Declara los archivos de configuración del paquete en la sección `extra.config-plugin` de `composer.json`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"extra\": {\n"
"        \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"            \"params\": \"config/params.php\",\n"
"            \"di\": \"config/di.php\",\n"
"            \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\",\n"
"            \"routes\": \"config/routes.php\",\n"
"            \"events\": \"config/events.php\",\n"
"            \"params-web\": \"config/params-web.php\",\n"
"            \"params-console\": \"config/params-console.php\",\n"
"            \"di-console\": \"config/di-console.php\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"name\": \"vendor/blog\",\n"
"    \"type\": \"library\",\n"
"    \"autoload\": {\n"
"        \"psr-4\": {\n"
"            \"Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\\": \"src/\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"    \"extra\": {\n"
"        \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"            \"params\": \"config/params.php\",\n"
"            \"di\": \"config/di.php\",\n"
"            \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\",\n"
"            \"routes\": \"config/routes.php\",\n"
"            \"events\": \"config/events.php\",\n"
"            \"params-web\": \"config/params-web.php\",\n"
"            \"params-console\": \"config/params-console.php\",\n"
"            \"di-console\": \"config/di-console.php\"\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Each `config-plugin` key is a config group name and each value is a path relative to the package root."
msgstr "Cada clave de `config-plugin` es un nombre de grupo de configuración y cada valor es una ruta relativa a la raíz del paquete."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use the common, web, and console groups consistently:"
msgstr "Usa los grupos comunes, web y de consola de forma coherente:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "`params`, `di`, `di-providers`, `di-delegates`, `events`, and `bootstrap` apply to both web and console entry points."
msgstr "`params`, `di`, `di-providers`, `di-delegates`, `events` y `bootstrap` se aplican tanto a los puntos de entrada web como a los de consola."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "`params-web`, `di-web`, `di-providers-web`, `events-web`, `bootstrap-web`, and `routes` apply to web entry points."
msgstr "`params-web`, `di-web`, `di-providers-web`, `events-web`, `bootstrap-web` y `routes` se aplican a los puntos de entrada web."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "`params-console`, `di-console`, `di-providers-console`, `events-console`, and `bootstrap-console` apply to console entry points."
msgstr "`params-console`, `di-console`, `di-providers-console`, `events-console` y `bootstrap-console` se aplican a los puntos de entrada de consola."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package defines a new config group, document how an application should load that group. Prefer the standard groups when you integrate with Yii services because application templates and Yii packages already use these names."
msgstr "Si tu paquete define un nuevo grupo de configuración, documenta cómo debe cargarlo una aplicación. Cuando te integres con servicios de Yii, es preferible usar los grupos estándar, porque las plantillas de aplicación y los paquetes de Yii ya usan esos nombres."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "After users install, update, remove, or dump Composer autoload files, the config plugin rebuilds the merge plan that Yii reads at runtime. If users edit their root package configuration manually, ask them to run:"
msgstr "Cuando los usuarios instalan, actualizan o eliminan paquetes, o regeneran los archivos de autocarga de Composer, el plugin de configuración vuelve a generar el plan de fusión que Yii lee en tiempo de ejecución. Si los usuarios editan manualmente la configuración de su paquete raíz, pídeles que ejecuten:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Put default options in `config/params.php`. Group package parameters under the Composer package name to avoid collisions:"
msgstr "Pon las opciones predeterminadas en `config/params.php`. Agrupa los parámetros del paquete bajo el nombre del paquete de Composer para evitar colisiones:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog' => [\n"
"        'postsPerPage' => 20,\n"
"        'cacheTtl' => 3600,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog' => [\n"
"        'postsPerPage' => 20,\n"
"        'cacheTtl' => 3600,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Application developers can override these values in their own `config/common/params.php`, `config/web/params.php`, `config/console/params.php`, or environment-specific parameter files."
msgstr "Los desarrolladores de aplicaciones pueden sobrescribir estos valores en sus propios `config/common/params.php`, `config/web/params.php`, `config/console/params.php` o en los archivos de parámetros específicos de cada entorno."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Do not read environment variables or global state from package code when a parameter can express the choice. Use parameters to configure services through DI definitions or service providers."
msgstr "No leas variables de entorno ni estado global desde el código del paquete cuando un parámetro pueda expresar esa elección. Usa parámetros para configurar servicios mediante definiciones DI o proveedores de servicios."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "DI definitions"
msgstr "Definiciones DI"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use `config/di.php`, `config/di-web.php`, or `config/di-console.php` for direct container definitions:"
msgstr "Usa `config/di.php`, `config/di-web.php` o `config/di-console.php` para las definiciones directas del contenedor:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostRepositoryInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => PostRepository::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'cacheTtl' => $params['vendor/blog']['cacheTtl'],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostRepositoryInterface::class => [\n"
"        'class' => PostRepository::class,\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'cacheTtl' => $params['vendor/blog']['cacheTtl'],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Prefer direct DI definitions when the configuration describes one service clearly."
msgstr "Es preferible usar definiciones DI directas cuando la configuración describe claramente un único servicio."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "DI service providers"
msgstr "Proveedores de servicios DI"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use a DI provider when registration belongs together as a reusable unit: several related services, aliases, factory definitions, or extensions."
msgstr "Usa un proveedor DI cuando el registro forme una unidad reutilizable: varios servicios relacionados, alias, definiciones de factorías o extensiones."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Register providers in `config/di-providers.php`:"
msgstr "Registra los proveedores en `config/di-providers.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Provider\\BlogProvider;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog/post-repository' => BlogProvider::class,\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Provider\\BlogProvider;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'vendor/blog/post-repository' => BlogProvider::class,\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Declare the group in `composer.json`:"
msgstr "Declara el grupo en `composer.json`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\"extra\": {\n"
"    \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"        \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"\"extra\": {\n"
"    \"config-plugin\": {\n"
"        \"di-providers\": \"config/di-providers.php\"\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "A provider can return several service definitions and extensions. Place the provider class in `src/Provider/BlogProvider.php`:"
msgstr "Un proveedor puede devolver varias definiciones de servicios y extensiones. Coloca la clase del proveedor en `src/Provider/BlogProvider.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Provider;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Log\\LoggerInterface;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\CachedPostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogProvider implements ServiceProviderInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function getDefinitions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            PostRepository::class => PostRepository::class,\n"
"            PostRepositoryInterface::class => static fn (\n"
"                ContainerInterface $container\n"
"            ): CachedPostRepository => new CachedPostRepository(\n"
"                $container->get(PostRepository::class),\n"
"                $container->get(LoggerInterface::class),\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getExtensions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Provider;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Log\\LoggerInterface;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\CachedPostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepository;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\PostRepositoryInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogProvider implements ServiceProviderInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function getDefinitions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            PostRepository::class => PostRepository::class,\n"
"            PostRepositoryInterface::class => static fn (\n"
"                ContainerInterface $container\n"
"            ): CachedPostRepository => new CachedPostRepository(\n"
"                $container->get(PostRepository::class),\n"
"                $container->get(LoggerInterface::class),\n"
"            ),\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getExtensions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Web packages can add routes through `config/routes.php`, declared as the `routes` group:"
msgstr "Los paquetes web pueden añadir rutas mediante `config/routes.php`, declarado como el grupo `routes`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Web\\Post\\IndexAction;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/blog')->routes(\n"
"        Route::get('')\n"
"            ->action(IndexAction::class)\n"
"            ->name('vendor/blog/index'),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Web\\Post\\IndexAction;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create('/blog')->routes(\n"
"        Route::get('')\n"
"            ->action(IndexAction::class)\n"
"            ->name('vendor/blog/index'),\n"
"    ),\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Route names should be package-prefixed. This avoids collisions with application routes and with routes from other packages."
msgstr "Los nombres de las rutas deben llevar como prefijo el del paquete. Así se evitan colisiones con las rutas de la aplicación y con las de otros paquetes."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Keep package routes small and overridable. If an application needs full control over URLs, document the actions and let the application define its own routes."
msgstr "Mantén las rutas del paquete pequeñas y fáciles de sobrescribir. Si una aplicación necesita control total sobre las URL, documenta las acciones y deja que la aplicación defina sus propias rutas."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use `config/events.php`, `config/events-web.php`, or `config/events-console.php` to attach package handlers to events:"
msgstr "Usa `config/events.php`, `config/events-web.php` o `config/events-console.php` para asociar los manejadores del paquete a eventos:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Event\\PostPublished;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\EventHandler\\ClearPostListCache;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostPublished::class => [\n"
"        ClearPostListCache::class,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Event\\PostPublished;\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\EventHandler\\ClearPostListCache;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    PostPublished::class => [\n"
"        ClearPostListCache::class,\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Handlers can be closures, callables, invokable objects, invokable class names, or DI aliases supported by the event dispatcher configuration. Prefer class names for package handlers because applications can override their dependencies through the container."
msgstr "Los manejadores pueden ser closures, callables, objetos invocables, nombres de clases invocables o alias DI admitidos por la configuración del despachador de eventos. Para los manejadores de paquetes, es preferible usar nombres de clase, porque las aplicaciones pueden sobrescribir sus dependencias a través del contenedor."

#. type: Title #
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md ../src/guide/views/asset.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assets"
msgstr "Assets"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package ships CSS, JavaScript, images, or fonts, define asset bundles as PHP classes. For example, place this class in `src/Asset/BlogAsset.php`:"
msgstr "Si tu paquete incluye CSS, JavaScript, imágenes o fuentes, define paquetes de assets como clases PHP. Por ejemplo, coloca esta clase en `src/Asset/BlogAsset.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Asset;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = __DIR__ . '/../../assets';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'blog.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"\n"
"    public array $js = [\n"
"        'blog.js',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace Vendor\\Blog\\Asset;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class BlogAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = __DIR__ . '/../../assets';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'blog.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"\n"
"    public array $js = [\n"
"        'blog.js',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Users can register the bundle from a view, widget, view injection, or action:"
msgstr "Los usuarios pueden registrar el paquete de assets desde una vista, un widget, una inyección de vista o una acción:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$assetManager->register(BlogAsset::class);\n"
msgstr "$assetManager->register(BlogAsset::class);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use `$sourcePath` for files shipped inside the package. Use `$basePath` and `$baseUrl` as the public target where the asset manager publishes them."
msgstr "Usa `$sourcePath` para los archivos incluidos en el paquete. Usa `$basePath` y `$baseUrl` como el destino público en el que el gestor de assets los publica."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Packages that need database schema changes should ship migrations and add their namespace or path to `yiisoft/db-migration` parameters."
msgstr "Los paquetes que necesiten cambios en el esquema de la base de datos deben incluir migraciones y añadir su espacio de nombres o su ruta a los parámetros de `yiisoft/db-migration`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "For namespaced migrations:"
msgstr "Para migraciones con espacio de nombres:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourceNamespaces' => [\n"
"            'Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\Migration',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourceNamespaces' => [\n"
"            'Vendor\\\\Blog\\\\Migration',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "For path-based migrations:"
msgstr "Para migraciones basadas en rutas:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourcePaths' => [\n"
"            __DIR__ . '/../migrations',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/db-migration' => [\n"
"        'sourcePaths' => [\n"
"            __DIR__ . '/../migrations',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Put this in `config/params-console.php` and declare it as `params-console` in `composer.json`."
msgstr "Pon esto en `config/params-console.php` y decláralo como `params-console` en `composer.json`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "This only contributes package migration locations. The application still needs `yiisoft/db-migration` installed and a database connection configured before migration commands can run."
msgstr "Esto solo aporta las ubicaciones de las migraciones del paquete. Para poder ejecutar los comandos de migración, la aplicación sigue necesitando tener instalado `yiisoft/db-migration` y una conexión a la base de datos configurada."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Package migrations must be stable after release. Do not edit a migration that users may already have applied. Add a new migration instead."
msgstr "Las migraciones de un paquete deben permanecer estables una vez publicado. No edites una migración que los usuarios ya puedan haber aplicado. En su lugar, añade una migración nueva."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "Traducciones"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If the package has user-facing messages, give it a dedicated translation category and register a category source in `config/di.php`:"
msgstr "Si el paquete tiene mensajes dirigidos al usuario, asígnale una categoría de traducción propia y registra una fuente de categoría en `config/di.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\CategorySource;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\IntlMessageFormatter;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\Message\\Php\\MessageSource;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'translation.vendor-blog' => [\n"
"        'definition' => static function (): CategorySource {\n"
"            $messageSource = new MessageSource(__DIR__ . '/../messages');\n"
"\n"
"            return new CategorySource(\n"
"                'vendor-blog',\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"                new IntlMessageFormatter(),\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"            );\n"
"        },\n"
"        'tags' => ['translation.categorySource'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\CategorySource;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\IntlMessageFormatter;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Translator\\Message\\Php\\MessageSource;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'translation.vendor-blog' => [\n"
"        'definition' => static function (): CategorySource {\n"
"            $messageSource = new MessageSource(__DIR__ . '/../messages');\n"
"\n"
"            return new CategorySource(\n"
"                'vendor-blog',\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"                new IntlMessageFormatter(),\n"
"                $messageSource,\n"
"            );\n"
"        },\n"
"        'tags' => ['translation.categorySource'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Store messages by locale and category:"
msgstr "Guarda los mensajes por idioma (locale) y categoría:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"messages/\n"
"    en-US/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"
"    de/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"
msgstr ""
"messages/\n"
"    en-US/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"
"    de/\n"
"        vendor-blog.php\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use the explicit category when translating:"
msgstr "Usa la categoría explícita al traducir:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$translator->translate('post.created', category: 'vendor-blog');\n"
msgstr "$translator->translate('post.created', category: 'vendor-blog');\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Themes"
msgstr "Temas"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "A package can ship view files and assets for a theme. Do not activate it from vendor package configuration. Instead, document the root application configuration needed to enable it. For the application template, this belongs in `config/web/params.php`:"
msgstr "Un paquete puede incluir archivos de vista y assets para un tema. No lo actives desde la configuración del paquete de terceros. En su lugar, documenta la configuración de la aplicación raíz necesaria para activarlo. En la plantilla de aplicación, esto va en `config/web/params.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/view' => [\n"
"        'theme' => [\n"
"            'pathMap' => [\n"
"                '@views' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/views',\n"
"            ],\n"
"            'basePath' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/assets',\n"
"            'baseUrl' => '@assetsUrl/vendor-blog',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/view' => [\n"
"        'theme' => [\n"
"            'pathMap' => [\n"
"                '@views' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/views',\n"
"            ],\n"
"            'basePath' => '@vendor/vendor/blog/assets',\n"
"            'baseUrl' => '@assetsUrl/vendor-blog',\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Themes replace view paths according to a path map. Document which application view paths your theme replaces and which asset URL must be published or exposed by the application."
msgstr "Los temas sustituyen las rutas de las vistas según un mapa de rutas. Documenta qué rutas de vistas de la aplicación sustituye tu tema y qué URL de assets debe publicar o exponer la aplicación."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Do not set `yiisoft/view.theme` directly in vendor package configuration. `yiisoft/view` already defines that key, and duplicate keys in the same configuration layer are not allowed."
msgstr "No establezcas `yiisoft/view.theme` directamente en la configuración del paquete de terceros. `yiisoft/view` ya define esa clave, y no se permiten claves duplicadas en la misma capa de configuración."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "If your package only provides optional theme files, do not make the theme active by default. Provide the view files, asset bundle, and a documented parameter snippet so the application can opt in."
msgstr "Si tu paquete solo proporciona archivos de tema opcionales, no actives el tema por defecto. Proporciona los archivos de vista, el paquete de assets y un fragmento de parámetros documentado para que la aplicación pueda activarlo si lo desea."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Console packages can add Symfony Console commands through `config/params-console.php`:"
msgstr "Los paquetes de consola pueden añadir comandos de Symfony Console mediante `config/params-console.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Command\\ReindexCommand;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-console' => [\n"
"        'commands' => [\n"
"            'blog/reindex' => ReindexCommand::class,\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use Vendor\\Blog\\Command\\ReindexCommand;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-console' => [\n"
"        'commands' => [\n"
"            'blog/reindex' => ReindexCommand::class,\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Command names should be package-prefixed. Keep command dependencies constructor-injected and registered through DI."
msgstr "Los nombres de los comandos deben llevar como prefijo el del paquete. Inyecta las dependencias de los comandos por constructor y regístralas mediante DI."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Application overrides"
msgstr "Sobrescrituras de la aplicación"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Package configuration is the default layer. The application can override it in its root package configuration.  Design for that:"
msgstr "La configuración del paquete es la capa predeterminada. La aplicación puede sobrescribirla en la configuración de su paquete raíz. Diseña teniéndolo en cuenta:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use package-prefixed parameter keys, route names, event handler IDs, and DI aliases."
msgstr "Usa claves de parámetros, nombres de rutas, identificadores de manejadores de eventos y alias DI con el prefijo del paquete."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Keep default configuration small and documented."
msgstr "Mantén la configuración predeterminada pequeña y documentada."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Avoid doing irreversible work during service registration."
msgstr "Evita hacer trabajo irreversible durante el registro de servicios."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Put optional integrations in separate config files or providers when they require optional Composer packages."
msgstr "Pon las integraciones opcionales en archivos de configuración o proveedores separados cuando requieran paquetes de Composer opcionales."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Test the package inside a minimal Yii application so the config plugin, DI container, routes, console commands, migrations, translations, and assets are exercised together."
msgstr "Prueba el paquete dentro de una aplicación Yii mínima para que el plugin de configuración, el contenedor DI, las rutas, los comandos de consola, las migraciones, las traducciones y los assets se pongan a prueba en conjunto."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "When a user needs to customize package configuration, they usually do not need to copy the package config file. They can partially redefine the needed keys in the application configuration."
msgstr "Cuando un usuario necesita personalizar la configuración de un paquete, normalmente no necesita copiar el archivo de configuración del paquete. Puede redefinir parcialmente las claves necesarias en la configuración de la aplicación."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "After changing config group mappings, they should rebuild the merge plan with:"
msgstr "Después de cambiar las asignaciones de los grupos de configuración, debe volver a generar el plan de fusión con:"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Releasing packages"
msgstr "Publicar paquetes"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Before tagging a release, test the package by itself and inside a minimal Yii application. Include a `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and `UPGRADE.md` when behavior or configuration changes require explanation."
msgstr "Antes de etiquetar una versión, prueba el paquete por sí solo y dentro de una aplicación Yii mínima. Incluye un `README.md`, un `CHANGELOG.md` y un `UPGRADE.md` cuando los cambios de comportamiento o de configuración requieran explicación."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
msgid "Use [semantic versioning](https://semver.org) for public releases. After the first release, do not edit migrations that users may already have applied; add new migrations instead."
msgstr "Usa el [versionado semántico](https://semver.org) para las versiones públicas. Tras la primera versión, no edites migraciones que los usuarios ya puedan haber aplicado; en su lugar, añade migraciones nuevas."
